This file violates keep-sorted on purpose. `.github/workflows/local-test.yml` runs the
action against it to exercise the annotation output, which the cases that pass cannot
show: a clean run emits no diagnostics to turn into annotations.

The extension is one blockwatch does not recognise, so every other case in that workflow
walks straight past this file. The annotation cases map it with `extensions:
"bwfixture=md"` to make it visible, and mark themselves `continue-on-error` because a
reported violation is the point.

<!-- <block name="out-of-order" keep-sorted> -->
- banana
- apple
- cherry
<!-- </block> -->
